Date: Wed, 9 Sep 2026 00:48:22 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] feat(github): isolate account context across indirect routes

Route monitor workers through public CLI re-entry without selected credentials.

Keep snapshot and evaluation credentials private to GitHub calls.

Preserve optional unbound behavior and hidden Windows launch semantics.

Task 5 TDD: initial matrix 7 pass/20 fail; final focused checks 384 pass/0 fail.

Parent-approved shared-boundary scope decisions: 3.
